<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">GAL-DOONDO Nouveau Testament</book>
  <para style="h">NGALATIYA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ngl</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ngalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wu Pawuli ku bisi-Ngalatiya</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda wusonika Pawuli ku bisi-</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ngalatiya</para>
  <para style="mt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni mukanda wusonika Pawuli ku minkwikidi mii ku Ngalatiya. Nkumbu zole kayenda koko mu kwe balonga Musamu Wumbote. Bayudayo na balembolo ba Bayudayo batambula wo mu kituka bankwa Klisto. Misamu emi Pawulu kabalonga : Ni kiminu kaka mu Yesu Klisto kilenda sa ti Nzambi kababongila bonso bantu balunungu. Kansi ha manima, bakaka mu Bayudayo bayenda nateye ko ku Ngalatiya, bata ti bakuluntu ba minkwikidi mi ku Yelusalemi babatambikidi. Ni batulula mimvimba mi balonga Pawuli, bata ti : Pawuli kadi andi nkatika ntumwa ko, na mi kana longa, midyandi mpe mi makedika ko. Babatela ti bonso yobobo balembo ba Bayudayo bakwikila mu Yesu, ni bwabobo yawu mpe bafweni landa bonso buna ta Misiku mi Mose. Na, dyambu di bavula nyema ni dyambu di nzengolo yi bubakala. Bata ti ni nzengolo yi bubakala yi kwe sanga ti Nzambi kabongila bantu bonso bantu ba lunungu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bisi-Ngalatiya ni bahidika bo, na Pawuli ni kayuwa myo. Wutoma fwema bubwingi, mu dyambu ti mu tumimina Misiku mi Mose ka dyadyo ko di kwe sanga ti bantu baba bantu balunungu. Ni hahoho Pawuli kasonikina ku bisi-Ngalatiya mu balonkisa ti ka bobobo ko Nzambi kata. Nzengolo yi bubakala yi bana zonzila yina ta ti mpeve yi muntu yifweni ba yitoma vedila. Wubatela ti tekila Abalahami wudi tata di Bayudayo kazengo bubakala, Nzambi wumubongila bonso muntu wulunungu. Kiminu kaka kikwe sanga ti Nzambi kabongila bantu bonso bantu balunungu, ni kyawu mpe ki kwe sanga ti baba na kizingu kikwe yangidikanga Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi buuku bedidi ebu yidi :</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Pawuli ntumwa yi kedika yidi, mi kana longa mi makedika mpe midi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:1-10">1.1-10</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Yandi bende Nzambi wusoola Pawuli mwanki ka ba ntumwa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:11-24">1.11-24</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Musamu Wumbote bwedi wuna toma ta (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 2:1-21">2.1-21</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Kiminu kaka kikwe sanga ti muntu kavulusu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 3:1">3.1</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:31">4.31</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Tuzolasaneeno yeto na yeto, na tubikeno Mpeve Yilongo kasungika kizingu kyeto (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 5:1">5.1</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 6:10">6.10</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">6) Mbote yi mansukina (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 6:11-18">6.11-18</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Meno Pawuli, nidi ntumwa, ka mu luzolo lu bantu ko hoti mu nzila yi muntu ko, kansi mu luzolo lu Yesu-Klisto na Tata Nzambi, wu mu fulukisa mu bafwa, <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />meno Pawuli ha kimosi na zimpangi zimvimba zi naani haha, meno nina sonika mukanda bewuwu ku mabundu ma kizunga ki Ngalatiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Bika Nzambi, Tata dyeto na Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto kalusakumuna na kaluhaana kiyenge! <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Klisto yandi bende wukiyekola mu masumu meto, mwanki katukula mu nza beyiyi yimbi, bonso buu luzolo lu Tata eto Nzambi. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Bika Nzambi kakemboso mimvu ka mimvu! Ameni.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musamu wumbote wumosi kaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Meno nina yituku mu manzangu ma lubeki mu nyafuna Nzambi, yondowo wu lutumisi mu mambote ma Klisto, bu lubangumukini mu landa musamu wumbote<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Musamu wumbote wuhiika, yobobo bedi samunanga musamu wumbote bewowo wuhiika, bedi lomba ku bantu mu vumina Misiku mi Mose, mu zengoso bu bakala mpe mu hambana na yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo. Kufwanikisa </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:3-5">Ngl 2.3-5</ref>,<ref loc="GAL 2:12-14">12-14</ref></char></note> wuhiika. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Kaani, kunaani musamu wuhiika wumbote, kansi kuu na bantu batiidi mu nata mvwanzi ha kati dyeno na batiidi mu vwanzikisa Musamu Wumbote wu Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Kansi, tala ti yeto hoti mbazi yi fumini ku yulu, yizidi mu luteela Musamu Wumbote wuswaswana na myomyo mi tulusamunini, bika kasingu! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Watuteka luteela, nabwesi ta wo dyaka: tala ti muntu wu lusamunini Musamu Wumbote wuswaswana na wo wulutambudi, bika kasingu!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Bwabu masiika ma bantu hoti ma Nzambi nina sosa e? Kadi bantu nina sosa mu yangidika e? Tala ti bantu nina sosa mu yangidika, nganunu nii kisadi ki Klisto ko.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwedi Pawuli ka tambudila na ka samunina Musamu Wumbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Mpangi zani, naluteela ti Musamu Wumbote wu nalusamunina wufuma ku muntu ko. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Kadi meno bende natambula wo ko, mpe nalongoka wo ku muntu ko, kansi Yesu-Klisto wunsamunina wo.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Yeno luyuwa nkadulu yiba naani, bu naba wukwikama mu Misiku na mu kinkulu ki Bayudayo. Luzebi bwedi nazomina dibundu di Nzambi, mpe bwedi nasosila mu mwangisa dyo. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Mu nsadulu ani yi Misiku na yi kinkulu ki Bayudayo, navudila zimpangi zani zi Bayudayo zi tuba mimvu mi mosi. Naba na vema dihyokidi kitezo mu kinkulu ki bankaka zeto.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Kansi Nzambi wunsoola tuka moyo wu ngudi ani, mpe mu mulemvo andi wuntumisa. <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Wuyena bumbote mu ndonka Mwana andi, mwanki nasamuna nkumbu andi ku yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo. Kansi nalomba malongi ku muntu ko, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />mpe natomboka ku mbanza Yelusalemi ko mu kwe longoka ku yobobo bantekidila mu ba zintumwa. Nina tumbu kwenda ku kizunga ki Alabi, mboki navutuka ku mbanza Damasiko. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Mimvu mitatu mihyoka, natomboka ku mbanza Yelusalemi mu kwe mokana na Sefase. Bilumbu kumi na tanu nahyokisa nandi, <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />nayena zintumwa zihiika ko, tala ti ka Zaki kaka ko, mpangi yi Mfumu. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Nzambi wuu mbangi ani, mu misamu bemimi mi nina lusonikina na mii mi luvunu ko!<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Mboki, nayenda mu bizunga bi Siliya na bi Silisi. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Kansi mu ntangu beyoyo, naba wuzabakana ko ku bantu ba mabundu ma Klisto maba mu kizunga ki Yuda. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Yawu bayuwa ti: «Muntu bewowo wedi tuzomanga, bwabu wuna samuna Musamu Wumbote wu kiminu wu kedi fyetikisanga.» <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Ni bedi kembisanga Nzambi mu dyambu dyani.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Pawuli na ntumwa zihiika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Mimvu kumi na miya mihyoka, navutuka dyaka ku Yelusalemi na Banabase. Ni nanata mpe Tito. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Natomboka kuuna mu dyambu ti Nzambi wu nzabikisa bobo. Mu kimoko kinkutikisa na minanga, nababangudila Musamu Wumbote wu nasamuna ku yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo. Natya ko ti kisalu kyani kiba kimpamba. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Kansi Tito mwisi-Ngeleke wuzyeta naani, bamukwika mu zengoso bu bakala bwandi ko, <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />mpeleko ha kati dyeto haaba na zimpangi zimbi. Zikota mu madyela mu kimvuka kyeto, mwanki ziketa kimpwanza kyeto ki tutambula ku Yesu-Klisto mpe batuvutula mindongo. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Kani ntangu yimosi, yeto tubatumimina ko, mwanki kikedika ki Musamu Wumbote kisikila mu yeno. <verse eid="GAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Bantu bebobo mpe baba minanga, naba nawu mfunu ko bonso bu baba, mu dyambu ti Nzambi kaswasikisanga bantu ko. Bantu bebobo bankwika kani musamu wuhiika ko. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Kansi yawu bayena ti Nzambi wunsoola mu samuna Musamu Wumbote ku yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo, bonso bu kasoola Petelo mu samuna wo ku Bayudayo. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Kadi yondowo wusa Petelo ntumwa ku Bayudayo, yandowo mpe sidi ti naba ntumwa ku balembolo ba Bayudayo. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Zaki, Sefase na Yoane baba bonso makunzi ma dibundu, babakula ti Nzambi wumpana kiyeko bekyokyo. Ni hahoho meno na Banabase batuhaanina mbote yi kooko bonso kidimbu ki kintwadi, mwanki yeto twenda tusadila ku balembolo ba Bayudayo, na yawu benda ku Bayudayo. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Batulomba kwandi mu bambukila bamputu moyo, mpe mu vema dimvimba na sadila bobo.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawuli wusemba Petelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Kansi meno nasemba Sefase bu kayiza ku mbanza Antiose, mu misamu mimbi mi kahidika. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Mu dyambu ti tekila bantu batambika Zaki batuula, wedi dyanga kintwadi na balembolo ba Bayudayo. Kansi bu batuula, wutatuka na wuyenda ba ha lweka, mu dyambu di bunkuta bu bantu bazengoso bu bakala bwawu. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Bayudayo bahiika mpe basadila nandi bobo. Mpe yandi bende Banabase bamuhukumuna mu nsadulu awu yi diisu ku nsye lukaya. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Kansi bu nayena ti kedi dyatila bonso budi kikedika ki Musamu Wumbote ko, ni nateela Sefase ha ntadisi yi bantu bamvimba ti: «Ngeye wudi Muyudayo, tala ti wuna dyatila bonso yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo, kansi ka bonso ba Bayudayo ko. Buna bwedi lenda kwika balembolo ba Bayudayo badyatila bonso Bayudayo e?»<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bayudayo na balembolo ba Bayudayo batambula mpulusu mu kiminu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Yeto Bayudayo bambutuka tudi, mpe tudi minsumuki mi nsi zihiika ko. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Kansi tuzebi ti muntu kakwe nungusungu ko mu dyambu ti wuna vumina Misiku, kansi mu dyambu di kiminu kyandi mu Yesu-Klisto. Ni hahoho, yeto mpe tusiidi kiminu kyeto mu Yesu-Klisto, mwanki tunungusu mu kiminu ki Yesu, kansi ka mu tumimina Misiku ko. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Kansi tumana sosa ti tuba balunungu mu dyambu di Klisto, yeto bende mpe tuna yenika minsumuki, buna bwaayenika ti Klisto mundongo wu masumu kadi e? Kaani, ka bobo ko! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Tala ti, ntungidi dyaka Misiku mi na bisidi, meno bende nina yenika kisafudi ki Misiku. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Mu dyambu ti ni Misiku misidi ti na ba bonso muntu wufwa, mwanki nazinga mu Nzambi. Mpe bankomini ha kulunsi ha kimosi na Klisto, <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />ka meno ko nina zinga, kansi ni Klisto wuna zinga mu meno. Kizingu kyani ki kinsuni, nina zinga kyo mu kiminu mu Mwana Nzambi wuntiidi na wuheeni luzingu lwandi mu dyambu dyani. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Mbisidi mulemvo wu Nzambi ko, kansi, tala ti mu Misiku tukwe bakilanga lunungu, buna mu mpamba Klisto kafwila.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Misiku hoti kiminu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />O Ngalatiya! Nkye buhulu bobo, nani wulusingidi e? Batoma lulonka Yesu-Klisto wukomo ha kulunsi. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Ntiidi ti lumpaana mvutu mu kyuhu bekiki: Lutambula Mpeve Yilongo mu dyambu ti luvumina Musiku, hoti bu luyuwa Musamu Wumbote e? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Bwedi lulendi bela na buhulu bubobobo e? Yeno lutonini mu Mpeve, bwabu lutidi mu sukina mu kinsuni e? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Mimvimba mi luhidika miba kwandi mimpamba e? Milendi ba mimpamba ko. <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Nzambi kwe luhaananga Mpeve Yilongo, mpe kwe sanga bimangu ha kati dyeno, nga kwe hidikanga myo mu dyambu ti lukwe vuminanga Musiku, hoti lukwe yuwanga na lukwe kwikilanga Musamu Wumbote e? <verse eid="GAL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Ni bwabobo mpe mu Abalahami: «Wukwikila mu Nzambi, na Nzambi wumubongila bonso muntu wu lunungu.» <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Zabeeno ti yobobo baa kiminu, yawu badi baala ba Abalahami. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Masonama mana tuteela ti Nzambi waanungisa yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo, mu dyambu di kiminu kyawu. Ni hahoho kateka teela Musamu bewowo Wumbote ku Abalahami ti: «Mu dyambu dyaku makanda mamvimba ma ha butoto maasakumunu.» <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Yobobo bakwikidi, basakumunu ha kimosi na Abalahami muntu wu lukwikulu. <verse eid="GAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Bamvimba bakwe tumiminanga Musiku badi ku nsye nsingulu, mu dyambu wusonama ti: «Wonso walembolo tatamana mu sadila misamu mimvimba bemyomyo misonama mu buuku di Musiku, waabaka nsingulu.» <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Mboki kunaani muntu wulendi ba wulunungu ha ntadisi yi Nzambi bu kavumini Musiku, kadi wusonama ti: «Muntu wulunungu waazinga mu dyambu di kiminu kyandi.» <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Tuzebi ti Musiku wufwanakani na kiminu ko, mu dyambu ti wusonama ti: «Wonso waasadila Musiku, waazinga mu Musiku bewowo.» <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Klisto wutukuula mu nsingulu yi Musiku, bu katambula mu ba nsingulu mu dyambu dyeto, bonso bu wusonama ti: «Wonso muntu wu baledika ha muti, kasingu.» <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Ni bwabobo, lusakumunu lu Abalahami mu Yesu-Klisto lutula mpe ku balembolo ba Bayudayo, mwanki tutambula mu kiminu, Mpeve yi kasila nsilulu.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musiku na nsilulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Mpangi zani, kifwani naabonga mu luzingu lu bantu: tala ti muntu sisidi mukanda wufwa, kunaani muntu lenda katula hoti lenda bwesa kima momo. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Ku Abalahami na nkuna andi basila nsilulu. Masonama mata ko ti: «na ku zinkuna zandi», yeka bonso ti bantu babingi, kansi ku muntu wumosi kaka: «na nkuna aku», mpila mosi ti, Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Ebu ntiidi muta: Nzambi wusa bonso bufwanakani mukanda wu fwa. Ka Misiku miyiza ku manima ma mimvu nkama ya na makumatatu mya katula wo ko, mpe myasa ti nsilulu yi Nzambi yikituka kima ki mpamba. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Tala ti ni mu Musiku tukwe tambudilanga fwa, buna tukwe tambudilanga dyo mu nzila yi nsilulu ko. Kansi tuzebi ti ni mu nsilulu Nzambi kalonkila bumbote bwandi ku Abalahami. <verse eid="GAL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Mfunu yi Musiku ni nkye e? Babwesa Musiku mu lonka mavanga malembolo fwanakana na luzolo lu Nzambi, natee nyizulu yi nkuna yi Abalahami yi kasiila nsilulu. Bambazi bazabikisa Musiku bewowo mu nzila yi nzonzi yimosi. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Kansi nzonzi kasanga kinzonzi ko tala ti ndambu yimosi kwandi yidi, mu dyambu ti Nzambi yandi hika wudi.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfunu yi Musiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Nganunu Musiku wulendi kakidila nsilulu zi Nzambi e? Kaani! Tala ti Musiku wuhaanu mu baka luzingu, nganunu ni mu Musiku mu fuma lunungu. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Kansi Masonama malonkidi ti nza yimvimba yi ku nsye kinanga ki masumu, mwanki minkwikidi mitambula nsilulu yiba sila Nzambi mu dyambu di kiminu kyawu mu Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Tekila kiminu kiba, tuba ku nsye kinanga ki Musiku, mwanki kiminu ki zabakana. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Ni hahoho, kiminu kiyiza ba munkengi eto natee nyizulu yi Klisto, mwanki tuba basungama mu kiminu. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Bwabu kiminu bu kizi ba, tusidi dyaka ku nsye luyalu lu munkengi bewuwu ko. <verse eid="GAL 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Buna yeno bamvimba lweka baala ba Nzambi mu kiminu mu Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Mu dyambu ti yeno bamvimba lutambula mbotokolo mu Klisto, lulweti Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Ni hahoho, kusidi Muyudayo na Mungeleke ko, kusidi nkole na muntu wukimpwanza ko, kusidi bakala na mukento ko, mu dyambu ti yeno bamvimba lweka muntu wumosi mu Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Tala ti luvwihulu ku Klisto, yeno ludi mu nkuna yi Abalahami, na luna ba yobobo baabyadila difwa di kamusila nsilulu.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Ebu ntiidi mu ta: ntangu zizingi tala ti muntu waabyadila difwa wakidi mwana wufyoti, kaa wuswasana na mundongo ko, mpeleko wudi mfumu yi bima bimvimba, <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />yandi wakidi ku nsye lutumu lu minyundudi na ku minkebi mi difwa natee mu kilumbu ki kubika tata andi. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Yeto mpe bumosi, bu tuba ntete baala bafyoti, tuba mindongo mi lulendo lu zimpeve zikwe yaalanga nza. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Kansi ntangu bu yilunga, Nzambi wutambika Mwana andi : wubutuka mu mukento, na wuba ku nsye lutumu lu Musiku, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />mwanki kakuula yobobo baba ku nsye lutumu lu Musiku, na tuba baala ba Nzambi. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Mu dyambu ti ludi baala bandi, Nzambi wutambika mu mitima myeto Mpeve yi Mwana andi yina lookana ti: «Aba, Tata!» <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Ni hahoho, sidi dyaka mundongo ko, kansi mwana. Tala ti mwana wudi, waabyadila mpe difwa di sila Nzambi nsilulu ku baala bandi.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bunkuta bu Pawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Mu ntama, yeno luzaba Nzambi ko na luba mindongo mi binzambi-nzambi bi luvunu. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Kansi bwabu luzebi Nzambi, hoti bwabu Nzambi wuluzebi. Bwedi lulendi vutukila lulendo lu zimpeve zikwe yaalanga nza zilembolo ngolo na mfunu e? Lutidi mu ba dyaka mindongo myawu e? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Lukwe toma zitisanga bilumbu, ngonda, ntangu, na mimvu! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Kadi bunkuta bu nani, mu kisalu kimvimba ki nasedi mu yeno ki ba kwandi kimpamba e?<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Mpangi zani, nina lubombidila mu ba bonso meno, kadi meno mpe bonso yeno nidi. Lumpidikidi kani musamu wumbi ko. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Bambukeeno moyo ti mu dyambu di kimbevo kiba nani, nayiza lusamunina Musamu Wumbote mu nkumbu yintete. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Lutoma kikwamisa mu kimbevo bekyokyo, kansi luntyaka ko, na lumbisa ko. Luntambula bonso mbazi yi Nzambi, bonso Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Kyese kibedi neeno, kwedi kyenzi e? Mu dyambu ti meno ndendi luteela kimbangi eki: tala ti bulendi ba, yeno lulendi katula meso meno mu mpaana mo! <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Neka bwabu mbeni eno bu nalutedidi kikedika e? <verse eid="GAL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Bantu bebaba bana lonka vema didingi ku yeno, kansi mayindu mawu ma mambote ko. Batiidi mu lukatula ku kwani, mwanki luba na vema ku yawu. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Bumbote budi mu ba na vema ntangu zimvimba mu misamu mimbote, kansi ka bu nii kaka kintwadi neeno ko. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Baala bani, myangala dyaka nina yena mu dyambu dyeno, bonso mukento bu kakwe banga na misongo mye butila, natee bu lwaaba nkatika bonso Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Ngunda na luzolo yi bedi nani mu ba kintwadi neeno mu ntangu beyiyi, mwanki nasanza nzonzolo ani. Mu dyambu ti nina kikwamisa mu dyambu dyeno!<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimpa ki Angali na Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Nteleno eti, yeno lutidi mu ba ku nsye lutumu lu Musiku, lukwe bakulanga ko misamu misonama mu Musiku e? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Wusonama ti, Abalahami wubuta baala bole babakala, wumosi na mukento wu mundongo mpe wuhiika na mukento wu kimpwanza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga musamu bewuwu mu buuku di Mbadukulu 16.15, 21.2 </char></note>. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Mwana wu mundongo wubutuka mu luzolo lu bantu, kansi wu mukento wu kimpwanza wubutuka bonso bubela nsilulu zi Nzambi.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Musamu bewuwu wudi bonso kimpa: Bakento ya babole bana lonka luwawanu lu mutindu zole. Lumosi lufuma ha mulandu wu Sinayi na luhaana mbutuka yi mindongo, luna lonka Angali. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Angali, ni mulandu wu Sinayi wu ku nsi yi Alabi. Wufwanakani na mbanza Yelusalemi yi ntangu beyiyi, mu dyambu ti mundongo kadi na baala bandi. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Kansi Yelusalemi yi mazulu yii kimpwanza, yawu yidi ngudi eto. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Kadi wusonama ti:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">«Yangalala kwaku, mukento wu kisita, ngeye wulembolo buta!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Duzumuka mu kyese ngeye wulembolo yena mpasi zi misongo mi mbutulu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Mu dyambu ti mukento wu babwongodi waavula ba na baala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">ke na yondowo wu wukwela.»<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Yeno, luzimpangi zani, yeno mpe baala ba nsilulu ludi bonso Isaaki. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Mwana wubutuka mu luzolo lu bantu wukwamisa yondowo wubutuka mu luzolo lu Mpeve. Bwabobo mpe mina bela mu ntangu eto beyiyi. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Kansi bwedi wudi wusonama e?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:30">«Kuma mundongo wu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:30">na mwana andi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:30">Kadi mwana wu mundongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:30">kalendi byadila fwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:30">na mwana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:30">wu mukento</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:30">wu kimpwanza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga musamu bewuwu mu mbadukulu 21.9-10</char></note> ko.»<verse eid="GAL 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Ni hahoho, zimpangi zani, tudi baala ba mukento wu mundongo ko, kansi ba mukento wu kimpwanza.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s1">Klisto wutuhaana kimpwanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Klisto wutukuula, mwanki tuba nkatika bantu ba kimpwanza. Ni hahoho, syameno, na lutambulandi ko ti babwesa lukanga mu kihangu ki kinanga.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Yuweno! Meno Pawuli nalutedidi ti: tala ti luzengoso bubakala, Klisto kaabwesa ba mfunu ku yeno ko. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Nalutedidi dyaka ti wonso muntu wa zengoso bubakala, fweti vumina Musiku wumvimba. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Yeno lukwe sosanga mu ba bantu ba ludedomo mu vumina Musiku. Bu luna sadila bobo, luna ba kitatu na Klisto. Mpe mulemvo wu Nzambi wusidi neeno ko. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Yeto, mu kiminu na mu lulendo lu Mpeve Yilongo, tuna kingila Nzambi katusa bantu ba lunungu. Bwabobo buu kivuvu kyeto. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Kadi, ku yobobo baa bakangama mu Yesu-Klisto, kuzengoso bubakala na kulembolo bwe zengoso ku mfunu ko. Kansi dyambu di mfunu, ni kiminu ki tukwe lonkanga mu nzolasani.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Lutona mu noka ntiinu bumbote. Kansi nani wulukakididi mu tumimina kikedika e? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Ndongosolo beyoyo yimbi, yi fumini ku yondowo wu lutumisi ko. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Bonso bu bakwe tanga ti: «Mwa kima kikwe vimbisanga kiputi kivimbisi kiputi kimvimba ki mampa.» <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Kivuvu ki nani mu Mfumu ti, mu myo mi lutadidi, luna yindula buhiika ko na meno. Kansi ku yondowo wu lutwadidi mvwanzi, ni kaba nani, waatambula kitumbu ki Nzambi.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Mpangi zani, mu myo mintadidi, tala ti bwabu nina tatamana mu longa nzengosolo yi bubakala, bila nki bana nzomina e? Tala ti bwabobo, nsamununu yi nkomono yi Klisto ha kulunsi yi lendi bwesa kwamisa muntu ko. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Bika bahokola yobobo bana sa mvwanzi ha kati dyeno!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Mpangi zani, balutumisa mu zinga mu kimpwanza. Kansi lu kitulandi kimpwanza bekyokyo kiba mpengomokono ku yeno mu sadila nsatu zeno zi kinsuni. Kansi lufweti twalasana yeno na yeno mu kati di zola. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Mu dyambu ti Musiku wu Mose wu kangamani mu Musiku wakwa wumosi ewu: «Zola mfinangani aku bonso nge bende.» <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Kansi tala ti luna kwe kazasani mpe luna kwe sasasani yeno na yeno bonso bibulu, kebeno kweno: nganunu lwaahondasana yeno na yeno.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kutwadusulu mu Mpeve Yilongo kansi ka mu kinsuni ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Misamu emi ntiidi mu luteela: dyatileeno mu ki Mpeve na nkatika luna hidika nsatu zi kinsuni ko. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Mu dyambu ti nsatu zi kinsuni zi bonso nsatu zi ki Mpeve ko, mpe nsatu zi ki Mpeve zi bonso nsatu zi kinsuni ko. Na zikwe nwanasananga yawu na yawu, mu dyambu ti lulendi hidika misamu mi lutiidi ko. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Ni hahoho, tala ti Mpeve Yilongo yina lutwadisa, buna lwaaba ku nsye lutumu lu Misiku ko.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Tutomini zaba kwedi nsatu zi kinsuni zikwe natanga: ku kindumba, ku busafu na ku misamu mi nsoni, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />kusambila biteki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Biteki:kukwikila mu bima bimvimba bikwe lembolo zitisanga Nzambi</char></note>, ku kindoki, ku nkindu, ku mayuma, ku kimpala, ku mfiti, ku kitantu, ku nkabani na ku kabu di hambukidi mu dibundu, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />ku nzinunu, ku kinduvu, ku kindyafu, na ku misamu mihiika mifwanakani. Nina lulwengisa bwabu bonso bu nateka bwe sa: yobobo bana mbelo beyoyo balendi kota mu Kimfumu ki Nzambi ko.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Kansi mbutu yi Mpeve Yilongo, ni zola, kyese, kiyenge, mvibudulu, nsalasani, mambote, kiminu, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />lembami na kukiyaala. Musiku wukanikini misamu bemimi ko. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Yobobo baa mu Yesu-Klisto bakomini kinsuni kyawu ha kimosi na nsatu mpe na nzinunu zawu ha kulunsi. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Tala ti mu Mpeve tudi bamoyo, bika tu dyatila mu Mpeve. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Tubandi bantu bakwe kitumpidikanga ko, tusosandi nyungu ko, mpe tuzininandi baneto ko.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s1">Kunatasana bizitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Mpangi zani, tala ti lu batikisi muntu wuna hidika musamu wumbi, yeno luna Mpeve yi Nzambi, lufweti muvutula mu lembami mu nzila yi sungama. Kansi kikeba nge bende, mwanki wulembolo kota mu ntontolo. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Natasaneeno bizitu yeno na yeno, ni bwabobo lwaalungisila Musiku wu Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Tala ti muntu wuna banzila ti mfunu kadi, mpeleko yandi muntu wumpamba kwandi wudi, wuna kihuna yandi bende. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Konso muntu ka fyongonina nkandulu andi, tala ti yilendi muyenisa kyese, kayena kyese mu dyambu di yandi bende. Kansi ka kifwanikisandi na wuhiika ko. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Mu dyambu ti kadi muntu kaanata kizitu kyandi.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Muntu bewowo wu bana longa Mambu ma Nzambi, kahaana mwa ndambu yi bimvwama byandi ku yondowo wuna mulonga.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Luhunukandi ko: basakininanga Nzambi ko. Kyonso kima ki kunini muntu, kyakyokyo mpe kaayonzika. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Tala ti muntu kunini mu yangidika nsuni andi, ni lufwa. Kansi yondowo waakuna mu yangidika Mpeve Yilongo waabaka luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu mu Mpeve Yilongo. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Tubiikandi mu hidika misamu mimbote ko, mu dyambu ti byaatwayonzika mu ntangu yifwanakani, tala ti tubebidi ko. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Ni hahoho, bu tubeki hwahwa, tuhidikeeno misamu mimbote ku bantu bamvimba, sungula ku zimpangi zeto batudi kiminu kimosi.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsikudukusu na zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Taleno nkye mutindu nsonikini meno bende mu kooko kwani bisono bebibi bi binene. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Bamvimba bebobo batidi mu kiyenikisa ha meso ma bantu, baalutuma lu zengoso bubakala, mwanki yawu bende balembolo kwamusu mu dyambu di kulunsi difwila Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Kadi yobobo bazengoso bubakala, yawu bende mpe bakwe vuminanga Musiku ko, kansi batidi ti luzengoso bubakala, mwanki bakizangula mu kidimbu bekyokyo ki balusidi mu nitu eno. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Mu meno, ndendi kizangula kaka mu dyambu di kulunsi difwila Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto. Mpe mu dyambu di kulunsi andi, nza ku meno yifwa yidi, na meno mpe wufwa nidi mu dyambu di nza. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Ni hahoho, ni wuzengoso bubakala, ni wulembolo bwe zengoso, bu mfunu ko. Dyambu di mfunu, ni kubutuka mbutuka yimoona.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kubutuka mbutuka yimoona. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yiyekini ti muntu beki mbotokolo na nsenzi ndyatulu andi.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Bika kiyenge na nkenda yiba ku bamvimba baalanda Musiku bewuwu na ku mukangu wumvimba wu Nzambi!<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Tuka ntangu beyiyi, kani muntu kankwamisandi dyaka ko, kadi mu nitu ani nina bifu bimputa na myangala mu dyambu di Yesu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Mpangi zani! Bika Mfumu eto Yesu-KListo kalusakumuna! Ameni.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>